{
  "category": "Emotion Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It is said that a KIRLIA that is exposed to the positive emotions of its TRAINER grows beautiful. This POKéMON controls psychokinetic powers with its highly developed brain.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "KIRLIA uses the horns on its head to amplify its psychokinetic power. When the POKéMON uses its power, the air around it becomes distorted, creating mirages of nonexistent scenery.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A KIRLIA has the psychic power to create a rip in the dimensions and see into the future. It is said to dance with pleasure on sunny mornings.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "The cheerful spirit of its TRAINER gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "The cheerful spirit of its TRAINER gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is highly perceptive of its Trainer’s feelings. It dances when it is feeling happy.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is highly perceptive of its Trainer’s feelings. It dances when it is feeling happy.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
